rnal/pose/closeout_review_policy.go:4:// pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit, ADR\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_review_policy.go:5:// closeout-review-policy-by-cost-and-benefit). An instance that adopts review\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_review_policy.go:351:// Order (spec pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit, \"One evaluator and\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_receipt.go:3:// Closeout receipts (spec pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit R4, R7).\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_receipt.go:199:// pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit R4, R7).\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_adr_associations.go:4:// closeout review evaluator (spec pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit).\npose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_review_policy_test.go:12:// Tests of spec pose-closeout-review-policy-by-cost-benefit. Every test name\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
